  "details": "Tested on PC and Android with multiple different users asked to test in different worlds across VRChat. Everyone got the same results and purposefully entering a legitimate untrusted url would bring up a completely different error explicitly stating the URL was Untrusted.\n\n1. Review the Trusted URL list to verify that SoundCloud is listed.\n\n2. Ensure Allow Untrusted URLs is disabled.\n\n3. Attempt to use AVPro with any SoundCloud link. Example link: https://soundcloud.com/zip-zap-523999143/tv-time-electro-swing-mix\n\n4. Enable Untrusted URLs.\n\n5. Witness that the SoundCloud link now works.\n\n6. Repeat from step 2 to notice how easy it is to replicate this issue regardless of the domains added to the web configuration on VRChat's website.\n\nVRChat Log (Repeats indefinitely):\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:46 Warning    -  [Video Playback] URL not allowed\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:46 Debug      -  [Video Playback] URL 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez' resolved to 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez'\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:46 Debug      -  [AVProVideo] Opening https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez (offset 0) with API MediaFoundation\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:47 Error      -  [AVProVideo] Error: Loading failed.  File not found, codec not supported, video resolution too high or insufficient system resources.\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:47 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Video error event: PlayerError\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:47 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Stop\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:47 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:SyncPlayer] Video stream failed: https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:47 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:SyncPlayer] Error code: Player Error\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:53 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Load Url: https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:53 Debug      -  [Video Playback] Attempting to resolve URL 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez'\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:53 Debug      -  NativeProcess.Start: started process id [Redacted]/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\Tools/yt-dlp.exe (...)\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  NativeProcess.HasExited: process exited with code 0, took 3368 ms. Command line: [Redacted]/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\Tools/yt-dlp.exe (...)\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Warning    -  [Video Playback] URL not allowed\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [Video Playback] URL 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez' resolved to 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez'\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [AVProVideo] Opening https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez (offset 0) with API MediaFoundation\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Error      -  [AVProVideo] Error: Loading failed.  File not found, codec not supported, video resolution too high or insufficient system resources.\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Video error event: PlayerError\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Stop\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:SyncPlayer] Video stream failed: https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez\n\n2025.10.19 21:47:56 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:SyncPlayer] Error code: Player Error\n\n2025.10.19 21:48:02 Debug      -  [VideoTXL:AVPro-1] Load Url: https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez\n\n2025.10.19 21:48:02 Debug      -  [Video Playback] Attempting to resolve URL 'https://soundcloud.com/nle808/i-love-disco-mix-by-maui-dj-joe-cortez'\n\n2025.10.19 21:48:02 Debug      -  NativeProcess.Start: started process id [Redacted]/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\Tools/yt-dlp.exe (...)\n\n2025.10.19 21:48:06 Debug      -  NativeProcess.HasExited: process exited with code 0, took 3351 ms. Command line: [Redacted]/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRC